# Untitled

Multi-scale regulation in S, N co-incorporated carbon encapsulated Fe-doped \(\mathbf{Co}_{9}\mathbf{S}_{8}\) achieving efficient water oxidation with low overpotential
Wenbin Wang\(^{1}\), Yang Yang\(^{1}\), Yang Zhao\(^{1}\), Shuzhe Wang\(^{1}\), Xiaomeng Ai\(^{2}\), Jiakun Fang\(^{2}\), and Youwen Liu\(^{1}\)
\(^{1}\) State Key Laboratory of Materials Processing and Die & Mould Technology, and School of Materials Science and Engineering, Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Wuhan 430074, China  \(^{2}\) State Key Lab of Advanced Electromagnetic Engineering and Technology, and School of Electrical and Electronic Engineering, Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Wuhan 430074, China
